        "content": "<p>fitzgen <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/issues/14699#issuecomment-6224091425\">commented</a> on <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/issues/14699\">issue #14699</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>It is possible that <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/blob/ce2794bbf28c4ae1d2afb6620b2de17ab8e7b740/cranelift/codegen/src/opts/div_const.rs\">https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/blob/ce2794bbf28c4ae1d2afb6620b2de17ab8e7b740/cranelift/codegen/src/opts/div_const.rs</a> is missing some cases or that our cost function for egraph extraction is not weighing things correctly. Needs more investigation.</p>\n</blockquote>",
